Task 4. Imagine that you are doing a project УTastes differФ together with your friend. You have found some illustrations and want to share the news. Leave a voice message to your friend. In 2.5 minutes be ready to:
give a brief description of the photos, justifying the choice of the photos for the project;
say in what way the pictures are different, justifying the choice of the photos for the project;
mention the advantages and disadvantages (1Ц2) of the two ways of spending free time;
express your opinion on the subject of the project Ц which of these ways of spending free time you would prefer and why.
You will speak for not more than 3 minutes (12Ц15 sentences). You have to talk continuously.

